<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Stations Needed to Build — Spacemolt KB</title>
<script>(function(){try{var t=localStorage.getItem('smkb-theme');if(!t){t=window.matchMedia&&window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: light)').matches?'light':'dark';}document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme',t);}catch(e){}})();</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../smui.css">
<style>
:root{--bg:#0d1117;--panel:#161b22;--panel2:#1c2128;--border:#30363d;--border2:#21262d;--text:#c9d1d9;--muted:#8b949e;--muted2:#6e7681;--dim:#adbac7;--link:#58a6ff;--link2:#1f6feb;--accent:#e3b341;--accent2:#d29922;--accent3:#9a6700;--up:#3fb950;--up2:#2ea043;--down:#f85149;--purple:#6c5ce7;--grid:#6e7681}
:root[data-theme="light"]{--bg:#ffffff;--panel:#f6f8fa;--panel2:#eaeef2;--border:#d0d7de;--border2:#d8dee4;--text:#1f2328;--muted:#656d76;--muted2:#8c959f;--dim:#57606a;--link:#0969da;--link2:#0969da;--accent:#9a6700;--accent2:#9a6700;--accent3:#7d4e00;--up:#1a7f37;--up2:#1a7f37;--down:#cf222e;--purple:#6639ba;--grid:#afb8c1}
.theme-toggle{position:fixed;top:.5rem;right:.5rem;z-index:10;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:.3rem .55rem;font-size:1rem;cursor:pointer;line-height:1}
.theme-toggle:hover{border-color:var(--link)}

 body{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:1rem}
 .factoids{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:12px;margin:1rem 0}
 .factoid{background:var(--bg-card,var(--panel));border:1px solid var(--border,var(--border));border-left:4px solid var(--purple);border-radius:8px;padding:14px}
 .factoid .big{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--link,var(--link))}
 .factoid .lbl{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-muted,var(--muted))}
 .charts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2rem;margin:1rem 0}
 .chart{flex:1;min-width:280px}
 .chart h3{font-size:1rem;margin:.2rem 0}
 .chart-body{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:6px;height:160px}
 .chart-col{flex:1;height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
 .chart-col .n{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--text-muted,var(--muted));height:14px;line-height:14px}
 .bar-track{flex:1;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:flex-end}
 .chart-bar{width:100%;background:var(--purple);border-radius:3px 3px 0 0;min-height:2px}
 .chart-axis{display:flex;gap:6px;border-top:1px solid var(--border,var(--border));padding-top:3px}
 .chart-axis .x{flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--text-muted,var(--muted))}
 .unbuildable-note{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--text-muted,var(--muted));margin-top:.5rem}
 table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.85rem;margin-top:1rem}
 th,td{border:1px solid var(--border,var(--border2));padding:.3rem .5rem;text-align:left}
 th{cursor:pointer;background:var(--bg-card,var(--panel))}
 td.num{text-align:right}
 .badge{font-size:.7rem;background:var(--accent3);color:#fff;border-radius:3px;padding:0 .3rem;margin-left:.3rem}
 .scrollx{overflow-x:auto}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<button type="button" class="theme-toggle" title="Toggle light/dark theme" aria-label="Toggle light/dark theme" onclick="(function(){var r=document.documentElement,t=r.getAttribute('data-theme')==='light'?'dark':'light';r.setAttribute('data-theme',t);try{localStorage.setItem('smkb-theme',t);}catch(e){}})()">◐</button>
<p><a href="index.html">← Did You Know?</a></p>
<h1>How Many Stations to Build Anything?</h1>
<p>The fewest distinct market stations you must shop at to source every part for one build, depth-aware, across all {{.Total}} items and ships. Count only — travel between stations is ignored. <b>BoM</b> = from raw ore; <b>Recipe</b> = from sub-assemblies.</p>

<div class="factoids">
 <div class="factoid"><div class="big">{{.SingleStation}}</div><div class="lbl">targets buildable from a single station</div></div>
 <div class="factoid"><div class="big">{{printf "%.1f" .AvgStations}}</div><div class="lbl">average stations per buildable target</div></div>
 <div class="factoid"><div class="big">{{.MaxStations}}</div><div class="lbl">hardest: <a href="../build-costs/{{.HardestID}}.html">{{.HardestName}}</a></div></div>
 <div class="factoid"><div class="big">{{.UnbuildableCount}}</div><div class="lbl">targets can't be built anywhere — parts aren't all sold</div></div>
 <div class="factoid"><div class="big">{{.BatchSensitiveCount}}</div><div class="lbl">need more stations to build 10 at once</div></div>
</div>

<div class="charts">
 <div class="chart">
  <h3>BoM — targets by station count</h3>
  <div class="chart-body">
   {{range .BoMHistogram}}<div class="chart-col"><span class="n">{{.Count}}</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="chart-bar" style="height:{{.HeightPct}}%"></div></div></div>{{end}}
  </div>
  <div class="chart-axis">
   {{range .BoMHistogram}}<span class="x">{{.Stations}}</span>{{end}}
  </div>
  <div class="unbuildable-note">+ {{.UnbuildableCount}} unbuildable anywhere</div>
 </div>
 <div class="chart">
  <h3>Recipe — targets by station count</h3>
  <div class="chart-body">
   {{range .RecipeHistogram}}<div class="chart-col"><span class="n">{{.Count}}</span><div class="bar-track"><div class="chart-bar" style="height:{{.HeightPct}}%"></div></div></div>{{end}}
  </div>
  <div class="chart-axis">
   {{range .RecipeHistogram}}<span class="x">{{.Stations}}</span>{{end}}
  </div>
 </div>
</div>

<h2>Every buildable target</h2>
<div class="scrollx">
<table id="main">
<thead><tr><th>Target</th><th>Category</th><th>Kind</th><th>BoM stations</th><th>Recipe stations</th><th>Example cover</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{range .Buildable}}<tr>
<td><a href="../build-costs/{{.ID}}.html">{{.Name}}</a>{{if .BatchSensitive}}<span class="badge" title="needs more stations to build 10">×10</span>{{end}}</td>
<td>{{.Category}}</td><td>{{.Kind}}</td>
<td class="num" data-sort="{{.BoM.Count}}">{{.BoM.Count}}{{if not .BoM.Exact}}*{{end}}</td>
<td class="num" data-sort="{{if .RecipeNA}}-1{{else}}{{.Recipe.Count}}{{end}}">{{if .RecipeNA}}N/A{{else}}{{.Recipe.Count}}{{if not .Recipe.Exact}}*{{end}}{{end}}</td>
<td>{{range $i, $s := .ExampleCover}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{$s}}{{end}}</td>
</tr>{{end}}
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p style="font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)">* = greedy upper bound (a proven minimum wasn't searched beyond 3 stations).</p>

<h2>Can't be built anywhere ({{.UnbuildableCount}})</h2>
<p>These can't be built at any combination of stations right now — one or more inputs have no market depth anywhere.</p>
<div class="scrollx">
<table>
<thead><tr><th>Target</th><th>Category</th><th>Kind</th><th>Missing input(s)</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
{{range .Unbuildable}}<tr><td>{{.Name}}</td><td>{{.Category}}</td><td>{{.Kind}}</td><td>{{range $i, $m := .Missing}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{$m}}{{end}}</td></tr>{{end}}
</tbody>
</table>
</div>

<script>
// Lightweight click-to-sort for the main table.
document.querySelectorAll('#main th').forEach((th, idx) => th.addEventListener('click', () => {
  const tb = th.closest('table').tBodies[0];
  const rows = [...tb.rows];
  const dir = th.dataset.dir === 'asc' ? -1 : 1;
  th.dataset.dir = dir === 1 ? 'asc' : 'desc';
  rows.sort((a, b) => {
    const ca = a.cells[idx], cb = b.cells[idx];
    const va = ca.dataset.sort ?? ca.textContent.trim();
    const vb = cb.dataset.sort ?? cb.textContent.trim();
    const na = parseFloat(va), nb = parseFloat(vb);
    if (!isNaN(na) && !isNaN(nb)) return (na - nb) * dir;
    return va.localeCompare(vb) * dir;
  });
  rows.forEach(r => tb.appendChild(r));
}));
</script>
{{if .LastUpdated}}<footer class="page-updated" style="margin-top:2rem;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid #333;color:#888;font-size:0.85rem;text-align:center">Market data last updated: {{.LastUpdated}}</footer>{{end}}
</body>
</html>
